cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "4Cast Lab"
abstract: "A free research and teaching laboratory for machine learning, econometrics and causal analysis. Forecasting (ML) trains, tunes and compares models honestly out of sample, explains them and tests causality (ML Granger causality, Double ML with refutation checks); Estimation (Econometrics) estimates and tests OLS, logit/probit, IV, ARIMA, ARDL, ECM, VAR/VECM and GARCH; AutoML builds a forecasting model in four steps; the Python Workbench runs Python inside the app, with a script of every run that checks each number. No coding needed; everything runs on the user's computer."
version: "5.0"
date-released: 2026-10-21
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22883216
authors:
